Package: claude-agents-indicator
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, wingpanel
Description: Claude Code sessions in the elementary OS panel
 Lists live Claude Code sessions in the Wingpanel, badges the panel and
 dock while a session waits on you, sends notifications, and jumps to the
 session's Terminal tab on click.

Package: claude-agents-tray
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Suggests: tmux, kitty, konsole, xdotool
Description: Claude Code sessions in the system tray
 Lists live Claude Code sessions in a tray menu on any desktop with
 StatusNotifierItem support (KDE Plasma, Ubuntu's GNOME, Xfce, Cinnamon,
 MATE, Budgie, waybar), shows usage and sends notifications. A click selects
 the session's terminal tab and raises its window.
 .
 Includes claude-agents-status for status bars, and a GNOME Shell extension
 that raises windows on GNOME Wayland.
